section <<~TEXT, markdown: true
  Hey, welcome to KiwiHacks! This is different from other online communities. We have high standards, and expect everyone to follow four principles:

  • Treat everyone with respect and kindness
  • Don't degrade our shared spaces
  • Make conflict productive
  • Be Good, not just Not Bad

  If anyone ever mistreats you, please let us know! Send a message to a moderator to let them know. And to see the full rules, please read the <https://kiwihacks.org/code-of-conduct|Code of Conduct>.
TEXT
